/T (Joshua Catton: For me, I really got an appreciation for Tanakh at Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim. I remember sitting in the kitchen on Shabbat afternoon, eating some leftovers and just reading Tanakh, getting very into it. That's a great memory for me. I ended up learning several books of Nebiim on my own. )
/E (Joshua Catton: For me, I really got an appreciation for Tanakh at Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim. I remember sitting in the kitchen on Shabbat afternoon, eating some leftovers and just reading Tanakh, getting very into it. That's a great memory for me. I ended up learning several books of Nebiim on my own. )
