/T (MM: What about when you got back to America? Do you see a difference in Joshua before Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim and Joshua after Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim?)
/E (MM: What about when you got back to America? Do you see a difference in Joshua before Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim and Joshua after Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim?)
/Pg 24 0 R
