497 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 225 0 R
/E (Joshua Catton: 100%. I'm much more knowledgeable- in Tanakh, in Gemara and in general. I also have more of a connection to Israel now that I've lived there for a full year. I was obviously connected before, but now it's even more so.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
498 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 225 0 R
/E (But more than anything, it gave me the tools I needed in life. October 7th happened soon after my year ended, and it put me on another level religiously. But I don't think I would have been able to take that big of a step without the tools I had from Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim. It prepared me.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
