2036 0 obj
<<
/Title (This year, Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim welcomed three Shana Bet \(second-year\) students, who - in addition to their own intense learning schedules - will serve as role models and mentors to the first-year students. The Shana Bet program offers a special opportunity to learn in a small group with Rabbi Shimon Alouf, focusing on practical application of Halakha, as well as learning with our Rosh Yeshivah, Rabbi Harold Sutton, and deepening both knowledge and skills in Gemara.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2027 0 R
/Next 2048 0 R
>>
endobj
